## Control {{controlId}}: Update malicious code protection mechanisms when new releases are available.

**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

{{#if tenantName}}
{{tenantName}} updates malicious code protection mechanisms for the {{primaryDomain}} CUI environment when new releases are available. Anti-malware definitions, scanning engines, and protection signatures are configured for automatic updates to ensure timely protection against emerging threats.
{{/if}}

{{#if cloudEnvironment}}
The {{cloudEnvironment}} environment uses Microsoft Defender for Endpoint and Microsoft Defender Antivirus, which receive automatic definition updates from Microsoft's Security Intelligence service. Update frequency is configured for real-time protection with cloud-delivered updates.
{{/if}}

{{#if cisoEmail}}
The ISSO ({{cisoEmail}}) monitors malicious code protection update status across managed devices and ensures that update failures are detected and remediated promptly. Update compliance is tracked through Microsoft Intune device compliance policies.
{{/if}}

